{"version":1,"content":"<p>如今上市的新車，不論價格高低，基本上都配有駕駛輔助系統，但問題就出現在這裏，很多廠家會將其宣傳為「智駕」，導致部分人在使用時出現錯誤的操作。據「公安部交通管理局」披露案例，本月7日，山東青島，高速交警接到舉報，<strong>稱一輛紅色SUV在高速上行駛時，駕駛人躺着睡覺，疑似藉助「智駕」操控車輛睡覺</strong>。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1586386.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-14T07:21:27.151900+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":151,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-14T07:00:06+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-14T07:14:40.549004+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-14T07:14:40.549004+00:00","content_hash":"bc7a971a42470232b55e585ef4c7962f0539ef427fbcfb5d32f19fb5c40ba44b","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}